{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal multiprofile model using transformer aggregation, achieving 57.9% validation accuracy (vs. 61.9% for the avgpool aggregation baseline) and 56.3% F1. The result suggests transformer aggregation may underperform compared to avgpool in this setup, though uncertainty remains about its relative effectiveness without direct comparisons to other aggregation methods. The fusion strategy and model configuration were unchanged from the baseline, isolating aggregation as the primary variable."
}

